                                        </div>
                                        <p>
                                            <span style="font-size: 18px;">Join a community dedicated to protecting rivers, restoring forests, and safeguarding the ecosystems we all depend on. As a member, you'll<strong> help fund conservation projects on the ground</strong>, have a voice in shaping our mission through voting rights at our General Assembly, and stay connected with exclusive updates on our work and campaigns.</span>
                                        </p>
