                                    <div class="col-lg-6 o_colored_level">
                                        <p>
                                            <span style="font-size: 18px;">Becoming a member of Uplift means joining a growing community of people who believe rivers and forests deserve real, lasting protection: not just good intentions. <strong>Your membership directly funds the work we do on the ground</strong>: cleaning polluted riverbanks, replanting native trees, monitoring water quality, and partnering with local communities who live alongside these ecosystems every day.</span>
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-lg-6 o_colored_level">
                                        <p>
                                            <span style="font-size: 18px;">But membership is more than a donation. As a member, you become part of the decision-making process, with <strong>voting rights at our General Assembly</strong> to help shape the direction of our campaigns and priorities. You'll also receive exclusive updates from the field, giving you a front-row seat to the impact your support makes possible: from newly restored forest sites to measurable improvements in river health.</span>
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </section>
