                                                        <span class="flex-grow-1">What does my membership support?</span>
                                                    </button>
                                                    <div class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#myCollapse" role="region" id="myCollapseTab289978_1" aria-labelledby="accordion-button289978_1">
                                                        <div class="accordion-body">
                                                            <p>Your membership directly funds our work protecting rivers and restoring forests — from cleanups and tree planting to water quality monitoring and partnerships with local communities. Every contribution goes toward real, on-the-ground conservation efforts.</p>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
